  "description": "Matona is a bold and hybrid blackletter font. Its delicate curves and refined details create a sense of sophistication and elegance. Matona brings a touch of charm and sophistication to branding, editorial designs, and more. We keep this font look strong, classic, vintage, and Elegant.  We love how ligature and alternate features you can mix and max to make a stunning design. Matona typeface offers extensive multilingual support and includes PUA unicode for easy access to special characters.\nMatona is a beautiful choice for any creative endeavor, and a great choice for watermark on photography, branding, logo design, quotes, album cover, magazine, and many other design projects. Matona is here to take your work to a high level!!!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Matona is a bold and hybrid blackletter font. Its delicate curves and refined details create a sense of sophistication and elegance. Matona brings a touch of charm and sophistication to branding, editorial designs, and more. We keep this font look strong, classic, vintage, and Elegant.&nbsp; We love how ligature and alternate features you can mix and max to make a stunning design. Matona typeface offers extensive multilingual support and includes PUA unicode for easy access to special characters.</p>\n<p>Matona is a beautiful choice for any creative endeavor, and a great choice for watermark on photography, branding, logo design, quotes, album cover, magazine, and many other design projects. Matona is here to take your work to a high level!!!</p>",
